        <mxCell id="19" value="&lt;b&gt;• 코어 고정 요소:&lt;/b&gt; GitHub Actions · S3 · ECR · Bazel · 컨테이너 개발환경(Dev Container) · AWS Signer · CloudWatch · EventBridge&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;• 업계 표준 계약:&lt;/b&gt; OCI(컨테이너 이미지) · Dev Container · Remote Execution API(REAPI 캐시) · SLSA(출처 증명) · CDEvents(이벤트 버스)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;• 격리된 교체 가능 블록:&lt;/b&gt; [빌드 이미지] AMI/ECR · [러너] EC2 Spot Fleet · [캐시] S3/REAPI · [서명] AWS Signer · [검증 실행기] · [배포 어댑터]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;• IAM 역할:&lt;/b&gt; 수신(lambda-role) · 작업(worker-role) · 감시자(cleanup-role) · 러너(runner-role: S3/ECR/Signer) · CI plan role(OIDC)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1400" y="955" width="765" height="195" as="geometry" />
